        <p>For me, TongaLang sits at the intersection of programming language implementation and a question about who feels invited into computing. I wanted to build something concrete enough to run, inspect and test, not just describe an idea. The next meaningful step is to put the language in front of more learners, gather structured feedback, and let that evidence guide what comes next.</p>

